---
title: Ma Fuersten's World-Famous Baked Caramel Corn
source.name: Ma Fuersten
tags: Desserts
---

Preheat oven to 225°F.

Place the @popcorn{6%qt}(popped) in a #very large bowl{} (or roasting pan).

Melt @butter{1%cup} in a #medium saucepan{}.

Stir in @brown sugar{2%cup}, @light corn syrup{1/2%cup}, @salt{1%tsp}, and @vinegar{2%tsp}.
Bring to a boil, stirring constantly. Then boil for ~{5%minutes} without stirring.

Remove from heat.
Stir in @baking soda{1/2%tsp} and @vanilla{1%tsp}.

Gradually pour over popcorn, mixing well.
Divide into 2 large #9x13" baking dishes{} or 1 large roasting pan.

Bake at 225°F for ~{45%minutes}, stirring every 15 minutes.

Place on aluminum foil to cool.

Break apart and store in an airtight container.
